  "system": {
    "description": "<p><strong>Psionic</strong></p><p>Make a <strong>Power Roll</strong> against a target within Close range. On a success, <strong>mark a Stress</strong> to implant a living biotic organism within the target, making them temporarily <em>Infested</em>. When a creature acts while <em>Infested</em>, they take <strong>d6</strong> kinetic damage, using your Proficiency. If an <em>Infested</em> creature marks their last Hit Point, the biotic organism ruptures. All creatures within Very Close range must make a <strong>Reaction Roll</strong> (13). Targets who fail take <strong>d20+5</strong> kinetic damage using your Proficiency. Targets who succeed take half damage.</p>",
